                                                "sense_id": "12edeb2d-66a6-3b66-a7fe-948e64c99ec3",
                                                "text": "The Altamaha-ha, as the serpent has been named, is said to be from twelve to twenty feet long, about two feet in diameter, and gunmetal gray on top with a creamy underside. Most descriptions suggest a creature that is part eel, part alligator, ..."
